INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-38','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',2,'choice','38. One of Chase Carey''s goals is to make Formula One more appealing to Americans.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','D','参考答案 D，依据原文整理。D 段明确将增加美国人的兴趣列为目标之一。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-39','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',3,'choice','39. A former motorbike parts dealer led Formula One for the past forty years.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','A','参考答案 A，依据原文整理。A 段介绍前摩托车零件商 Ecclestone 领导一级方程式长达四十年。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-40','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',4,'choice','40. Chase Carey thought the audience of Formula One could be made to share his feeling about the race.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','M','参考答案 M，依据原文整理。M 段说 Carey 认为自己观看比赛的震撼感可以传达给观众。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-41','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',5,'choice','41. Chase Carey used to serve as a top advisor for a major broadcasting company.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','J','参考答案 J，依据原文整理。J 段说明 Carey 曾在 Fox Broadcasting Company 多年担任高级顾问。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-42','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',6,'choice','42. Chase Carey intends to make connections easier between the audience and the Formula One racers.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','F','参考答案 F，依据原文整理。F 段的计划包括改变车迷体验，让观众更容易与赛事中的人建立联系。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-43','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',7,'choice','43. The new leader of Formula One admitted he was not super interested in car racing.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','C','参考答案 C，依据原文整理。C 段说新任负责人 Carey 自己承认并非狂热赛车迷。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-44','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',8,'choice','44. People''s opinions differ as to whether Formula One can be promoted in the U.S.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','H','参考答案 H，依据原文整理。H 段指出人们对一级方程式能否在美国扩大影响的意见不一。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
INSERT INTO questions (id,section_id,position,type,prompt,options_json,answer_text,explanation,points) VALUES ('cet4-2023-06-2-section-3-q-45','cet4-2023-06-2-section-3',9,'choice','45. Compared with other racing series, Formula One focuses more on speed and involves more danger.','[{"key":"A","text":"段落 A"},{"key":"B","text":"段落 B"},{"key":"C","text":"段落 C"},{"key":"D","text":"段落 D"},{"key":"E","text":"段落 E"},{"key":"F","text":"段落 F"},{"key":"G","text":"段落 G"},{"key":"H","text":"段落 H"},{"key":"I","text":"段落 I"},{"key":"J","text":"段落 J"},{"key":"K","text":"段落 K"},{"key":"L","text":"段落 L"},{"key":"M","text":"段落 M"},{"key":"N","text":"段落 N"}]','K','参考答案 K，依据原文整理。K 段强调一级方程式比其他系列赛事更突出速度、危险和风险。',2) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET position=EXCLUDED.position,type=EXCLUDED.type,prompt=EXCLUDED.prompt,options_json=EXCLUDED.options_json,answer_text=EXCLUDED.answer_text,explanation=EXCLUDED.explanation,points=EXCLUDED.points;
